(A3) THE WITHIN-TYPE MOUTH COUNTERFACTUAL on SPEAK — A-RW (lr 0.01) retrained to 10,000 per seed; TRUTH = the word is true of the target and of no other thing in view (the world's truth). Readings: the forced name of ONE declared type (name_forced over shape / colour / size), and the type chosen by the within-type posterior margin (q = p_w / Σ_type p_w; top − runner-up; declared). The law's own TRUTH on the same items beside.
   CAVEAT: NAME's 0.93–0.95 («what is this?» emits the true word) is read on ONE-THING test scenes; the SPEAK items are 2- and 3-thing scenes (a different population), and a word true of the target may also be true of another thing.
